Meta.documentation:Number.divide
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Divides the first Number by every Number that follows.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first Number in the flow is the dividend; every Number after it is
Meta.documentation:divided into the running result. Division of exact rationals never loses
Meta.documentation:precision (7 / 2 is exactly 3.5).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_dividend — the first Number: the one being divided
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each divisor, applied in order
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the quotient, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:7 Number:2]>>Number.divide:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:3.5
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.multiply Number.modulo
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

